## Data + Layout

```plotly
{
    data: [
        {
            x: ['Apples', 'Oranges', 'Bananas', 'Grapes'],
            y: [20, 15, 30, 25],
            type: 'bar',
            marker: {
                color: ['#FF6384', '#36A2EB', '#FFCE56', '#4BC0C0']
            }
        }
    ],
    layout: {
        title: { text: 'Fruit Sales' },
        xaxis: { title: { text: 'Fruit Type' } },
        yaxis: { title: { text: 'Quantity Sold' } },
        height: 600
    }
}
```
